{"title":"2012 UNCO Math Contest II Problems/Problem 4","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem\">Problem</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2012_UNCO_Math_Contest_II_Problems/Problem_4&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>a) What is the largest integer <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/7/4/174fadd07fd54c9afe288e96558c92e0c1da733a.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$n$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"13\" height=\"10\" /> for which <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/b/a/5ba459f84f15addbce87fb6147f8502ca3899356.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$n^3+1631$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"75\" height=\"16\" /> is divisible by <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/b/d/7bd2246f2aaaed04376c00063cfa9b26ad9c47f0.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$n+11$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"50\" height=\"13\" />&#160;?\n</p><p>(b) For how many positive integer values of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/7/4/174fadd07fd54c9afe288e96558c92e0c1da733a.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$n$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"13\" height=\"10\" /> is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/b/a/5ba459f84f15addbce87fb6147f8502ca3899356.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$n^3+1631$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"75\" height=\"16\" /> divisible by <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/b/d/7bd2246f2aaaed04376c00063cfa9b26ad9c47f0.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$n+11$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"50\" height=\"13\" />?\n</p><p><br />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution\">Solution</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2012_UNCO_Math_Contest_II_Problems/Problem_4&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Solution\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>(a) <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/a/2/9a2815ecb054fadd5031fb990e85e4ec26a00879.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$289$\" width=\"26\" height=\"12\" /> (b) <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/6/8/c6878713578626763c38433b3f4c8c2205ad0c15.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$11$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"20\" height=\"14\" />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"See_Also\">See Also</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2012_UNCO_Math_Contest_II_Problems/Problem_4&amp;action=edit&amp;section=3\" title=\"Edit section: See Also\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"margin:0.5em auto; font-size:95%; border:1px solid black; width:80%;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td style=\"background:#ccf;text-align:center;\" colspan=\"3\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2012_UNCO_Math_Contest_II\" title=\"2012 UNCO Math Contest II\">2012 UNCO Math Contest II</a></b> (<b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2012_UNCO_Math_Contest_II_Problems\" title=\"2012 UNCO Math Contest II Problems\">Problems</a></b> • <b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2012_UNCO_Math_Contest_II_Answer_Key\" title=\"2012 UNCO Math Contest II Answer Key\">Answer Key</a></b> • <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"http://uncmathcontest.wordpress.com/\">Resources</a>)\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Preceded&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2012_UNCO_Math_Contest_II_Problems/Problem_3\" title=\"2012 UNCO Math Contest II Problems/Problem 3\">Problem 3</a></b>\n</td>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Followed&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2012_UNCO_Math_Contest_II_Problems/Problem_5\" title=\"2012 UNCO Math Contest II Problems/Problem 5\">Pr